    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"being gentle\" part feels impossible though. everything i do feels pointless. like i spent 25 years being someone's everything, and now i'm just... zero. there's no purpose here. i look in the mirror and it's like i'm looking at a stranger. i just feel so incredibly empty, like there's literally no substance left inside me to keep going.",
